# Plans: Closest Workspace, Committed With The Work

- Put every plan in the `.cursor/plans/` of the project it changes. NEVER `~/.cursor/plans/`.
- Commit the plan in the same commit as the work it plans. A plan for work already committed gets its own `DOC` commit straight away.
